# of SOM/som/makefile in osfree-project/osfree (https://github.com/osfree-project/osfree,
# BSD-3-Clause); the same numbers as Free Pascal's som.pas, not verified against
# IBM's som.lib. 48–3071: IBM's later exports, not known yet. 3072–4095: Warpine's
# own (SOM 2.x functions whose IBM numbers are unknown, imported by name; Wrp*);
